{"status":"ok","message-type":"work","message-version":"1.0.0","message":{"indexed":{"date-parts":[[2026,8,14]],"date-time":"2026-08-14T17:26:42Z","timestamp":1786728402341,"version":"build-2736575974"},"posted":{"date-parts":[[2021]]},"group-title":"SSRN","reference-count":1,"publisher":"Elsevier BV","content-domain":{"domain":[],"crossmark-restriction":false},"short-container-title":[],"abstract":"<jats:p>The purpose of the project \u201cFace Mask Detection Using Machine Learning\u201d is to create a tool that identifies the image of a human that can calculate the probability that he\/she wearing a mask or not. Due to COVID, wearing a face mask is must in order to stay safe. As the country starts going through various stages of reopening, face masks have become an important element of our daily lives to stay safe. Wearing face masks will be required in order to socialize or conduct business. So, this application utilizes a camera to detect if a person is wearing a mask or not.<\/jats:p>","DOI":"10.2139\/ssrn.3925736","type":"posted-content","created":{"date-parts":[[2021,9,21]],"date-time":"2021-09-21T08:05:40Z","timestamp":1632211540000},"source":"Crossref","is-referenced-by-count":2,"title":["Face Mask Detection Using Machine Learning"],"prefix":"10.2139","author":[{"given":"Kalla","family":"Kiran","sequence":"first","affiliation":[],"role":[{"vocabulary":"crossref","role":"author"}]},{"given":"Bokka Vamsi","family":"Kiran","sequence":"additional","affiliation":[],"role":[{"vocabulary":"crossref","role":"author"}]},{"given":"Devarapalli Cheswanth","family":"Sai","sequence":"additional","affiliation":[],"role":[{"vocabulary":"crossref","role":"author"}]},{"given":"Gaggala Vijay","family":"Vamsi","sequence":"additional","affiliation":[],"role":[{"vocabulary":"crossref","role":"author"}]},{"given":"Pitta Rani","family":"Salomi","sequence":"additional","affiliation":[],"role":[{"vocabulary":"crossref","role":"author"}]}],"member":"78","reference":[{"key":"ref1"}],"c